    {
      "QuestionID": 530886,
      "SubjectID": 123,
      "TopicID": 15524,
      "TopicRef": ".",
      "TopicName": ". ALL THE WORLD’S A  STAGE  (POEM)",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">All the world's a stage,</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">And all the men and women merely players;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">They have their exits and their entrances;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">And one man in his time plays many parts,</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 530891,
      "SubjectID": 123,
      "TopicID": 15524,
      "TopicRef": ".",
      "TopicName": ". ALL THE WORLD’S A  STAGE  (POEM)",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">His acts being seven ages. At first the infant,</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Mewling and puking in the nurse's arms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">And then the whining schoolboy, with his satchel</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">And shining morning face, creeping like snail</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 530894,
      "SubjectID": 123,
      "TopicID": 15524,
      "TopicRef": ".",
      "TopicName": ". ALL THE WORLD’S A  STAGE  (POEM)",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Unwillingly to school. And then the lover,</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Sighing like furnace, with a woeful ballad</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Made to his mistress' eyebrow. Then a soldier,</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Full of strange oaths, and bearded like the pard,</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 530896,
      "SubjectID": 123,
      "TopicID": 15524,
      "TopicRef": ".",
      "TopicName": ". ALL THE WORLD’S A  STAGE  (POEM)",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Jealous in honour, sudden and quick in quarrel,</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Seeking the bubble reputation</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Even in the cannon's mouth. And then the justice,</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">In fair round belly with good capon lined,</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 530898,
      "SubjectID": 123,
      "TopicID": 15524,
      "TopicRef": ".",
      "TopicName": ". ALL THE WORLD’S A  STAGE  (POEM)",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">With eyes severe and beard of formal cut,</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Full of wise saws and modern instances;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">And so he plays his part. The sixth age shifts</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Into the lean and slipper'd pantaloon,</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
